question:
Atlassian managerial round (Senior Software Engineer, P50). Reported questions:

- how you handled a **project with vague requirements**;
- how you **helped a team member grow**;
- a **conflict with your manager**;
- whether you ever **put team goals ahead of your personal goals**;
- whether you ever **convinced other teams** to align with your thinking.

Other reports of this round also mention opposing someone's technical approach and improving a system on your own initiative.
